flowchart TD
  MSG[Message queued] --> RENDER[Render handoff prompt]
  RENDER --> SAFETY[Classify input safety]
  SAFETY --> POLICY{Policy allows?}
  POLICY -- No --> APPROVAL[Approval Queue]
  POLICY -- Yes --> READY{Agent likely awaiting input?}
  READY -- No --> WAIT[Wait / inbox]
  READY -- Yes --> LOCK{Input lock available?}
  LOCK -- No --> WAIT
  LOCK -- Yes --> PASTE[Bracketed paste]
  PASTE --> ENTER[Optional Enter]
  ENTER --> EVENT[Write event log]
  EVENT --> DONE[Delivery status = Delivered]
